1
00:00:00,142 --> 00:00:07,216
Step 1. Seeds. Seeds can be small or large,
smooth or rough. When they fall to the ground

2
00:00:07,216 --> 00:00:12,979
or are planted in the soil, they can begin to
grow. Inside each seed, there is a tiny plant

3
00:00:12,979 --> 00:00:18,351
waiting to sprout. For a seed to grow, it needs
water, sunlight, and a suitable temperature.

4
00:00:18,552 --> 00:00:20,813
Without these, the seed will not germinate.

